WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:03.269
ZENDAYA:
<i> We've become very, very close</i>

00:00:03.369 --> 00:00:05.772 line:0%
over these past
however many months.

00:00:05.872 --> 00:00:07.107 line:0%
Because I think you have to.

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:09.509
♪ (MUSIC PLAYING) ♪

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:12.879
We didn't do, like,
a chemistry test or anything.

00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:14.213
Yeah, that's the thing,
is like, usually,

00:00:14.314 --> 00:00:15.381
with that kind of relationship,

00:00:15.481 --> 00:00:17.116
you do,
like, a reading together.

00:00:17.216 --> 00:00:18.651
-Right.
-But we didn't.

00:00:18.751 --> 00:00:19.819
-Yeah.
-We have chemistry.

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:21.287
We got lucky. (CHUCKLES)

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:23.155
Well, you're kinda forced to be
in these really intense

00:00:23.255 --> 00:00:27.226
in these really intense
situations emotionally.

00:00:27.326 --> 00:00:29.595
The places
we had to go together...

00:00:29.695 --> 00:00:30.663
(ZENDAYA CHUCKLES)

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:31.831
Before we might've been there

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:33.566
in, like,
our real-life friendship,

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:36.368
Rue and Jules were already
going there.

00:00:36.468 --> 00:00:39.506
RUE:<i> I've never met anyone
 in my entire life like Jules.</i>

00:00:40.973 --> 00:00:42.341
I think the relationship
goes through,

00:00:42.441 --> 00:00:44.877
like, a lot of different levels.

00:00:45.277 --> 00:00:49.015
Rue honestly and immediately
falls in love with Jules.

00:00:49.115 --> 00:00:54.053
She just has this want
to just make her happy.

00:00:54.153 --> 00:00:55.755
And I think
this is the first time

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:59.692
that we get to see Rue, like,
genuinely happy about life.

00:00:59.792 --> 00:01:01.460
There feels like
there's a little bit of a light

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:03.029
at the end
of the tunnel for her.

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:06.132
So, I think she goes really hard
really fast,

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:10.437
a little faster than maybe, um,
Jules is prepared for.

00:01:11.203 --> 00:01:13.038
Baby, just... take your time.

00:01:13.238 --> 00:01:14.841
You've come a long way.

00:01:15.674 --> 00:01:16.409
You're delicate.

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:19.779
I think episode eight
is really special

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:23.249
because Rue and Jules
have finally gotten to a place

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:26.753
where they're aware
of their love for each other.

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:29.255
ZENDAYA:<i> It's Rue's idea
to run away in the first place.</i>

00:01:29.555 --> 00:01:31.590
She wants, more than anything,
to be with Jules.

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:35.328
There's nobody on Jules's level
in her eyes.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:38.631
I think she's just repeating
and thinking about

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:41.000
all the trauma she's already
kind of caused her family.

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.535
In that split moment,

00:01:43.035 --> 00:01:44.837
she just thinks about
her mom and her little sister,

00:01:44.937 --> 00:01:48.207
which is, like, something that
we've never really seen her do.

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:49.742
<i> We love them together</i>

00:01:49.843 --> 00:01:53.179
<i> and we want them
 to finally be together.</i>

00:01:53.513 --> 00:01:55.782
And they have this moment
where it's like, "Oh my gosh,

00:01:55.882 --> 00:01:59.051
they finally are in love,
and they can run off together,"

00:01:59.151 --> 00:02:00.819
and then everything just
comes crashing down.

00:02:00.919 --> 00:02:05.191
Even though their last moment,
it didn't follow through,

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:07.326
their love still exists.

00:02:07.426 --> 00:02:09.395
-We hope they make it.
-(BOTH LAUGH)

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:12.131
Our cast has gotten very close
with each other

00:02:12.231 --> 00:02:14.566
because if they're not
like literally naked
in front of each other,

00:02:14.666 --> 00:02:17.003
they've had to be
emotionally naked
in front of each other.

00:02:17.103 --> 00:02:19.605
She's seen me in every form.

00:02:19.705 --> 00:02:21.340
The worst, the best.

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:23.075
-Vice versa.
-And vice versa.

00:02:23.175 --> 00:02:24.877
So, it's like
there's no judgment...

00:02:24.977 --> 00:02:27.814
-We don't have to hide anything.
-It's all love, nothing to hide.

00:02:28.248 --> 00:02:31.251
I feel like I've got, like,
a new sister.

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:34.220
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

